From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/25] apklayer: tls-dtpoff

R_*_DTPOFF (the offset of a thread-local variable in its module's TLS block) stored sym_addr, which includes the library's load address: ELF TLS through __tls_get_addr (x86_64; arm64 code uses TLS descriptors) then returned base + (load address + offset), a doubled pointer (ApkAssets.nativeLoad crashed in zip_archive::Inflate on a PC).

apklayer patch: step 20 of the former scripts/patch-bionic-translation.sh (see docs/PATCHES.md), patch 0025 of patches/bionic_translation.
---
 linker/linker.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/linker/linker.c b/linker/linker.c
index 8592c2f..fdb550f 100644
--- a/linker/linker.c
+++ b/linker/linker.c
@@ -1984,8 +1984,8 @@ static int apkenv_reloc_library(soinfo *si, REL_TYPE *rel, size_t count)
 		case R_GENERIC_TLS_DTPMOD:
 			*((ElfW(Addr) *)reloc) = si->tls_slot_id;
 			break;
-		case R_GENERIC_TLS_DTPREL:
-			*((ElfW(Addr) *)reloc) = sym_addr + get_addend(rel);
+		case R_GENERIC_TLS_DTPREL: /* apklayer patch: see docs/PATCHES.md */
+			*((ElfW(Addr) *)reloc) = (s ? s->st_value : sym ? si->symtab[sym].st_value : 0) + get_addend(rel);
 			break;
 #if defined(__aarch64__)
 		case R_AARCH64_IRELATIVE: { /* apklayer patch: IRELATIVE (ifunc), see docs/PATCHES.md */
